<title>CHILE: Chile's Escondida May copper output rises.</title>
<headline>Chile's Escondida May copper output rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Minera Escondida Limitada reported the following copper and gold production figures for May.</p>
<p> COPPER (tonnes)		 May 1997		May 1996</p>
<p> Copper in concentrates	113,840		  93,281</p>
<p> Copper cathodes		   6,157		   3,664</p>
<p> Total			     119,997		  96,945</p>
<p>			    January-May 1997   January-May 1996</p>
<p> Total			     406,342		 341,928</p>
<p>				     May 1997		May 1996</p>
<p> GOLD (ounces)		    25,188		  20,638</p>
<p>NOTE: Minera Escondida is owned by Broken Hill Proprietary and RTZ Corp Plc.</p>
<p>(( --Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
